<title>HONG KONG: Union Bank mandates US$75 mln FRCD issue.</title>
<headline>Union Bank mandates US$75 mln FRCD issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of the Philippines has mandated four banks to arrange a US$75 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The certificates will have a maturity of three years.</p>
<p>The four arrangers are Standard Chartered Investment Banking, Merrill Lynch Far East, Dresdner South East Asia and LTCB Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
